{"version":1,"key":"card:394","content":{"id":394,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03f15bca-b7ec-4354-8529-473c40a299f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以通过 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":101,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":97,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"204507c0-4569-4eb4-922d-fa11656fa37c","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ls -R"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来查看一个目录的结构，它可以显示该目录包含的所有文件以及子目录，以及子目录下包含的文件和目录，但是通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ls -R"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 显示的信息有点难以阅读，在讲解其它命令之前，这里介绍一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的工具，它可以以树状的形式显示目录结构。下面给出两种方案显示目录结构，可以看到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令的输出可读性更强。"}]},{"type":"tabs","tauContract":"0256f72bf503014a7ea32d073aa02da06da7e88c98797870e4d49fa627404693","collabId":"b8933ed5-8d74-45cc-8572-f233e2b511dc","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"ac6c4539-2ddf-4668-a97e-341a7bd6083d","title":"ls -R","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"45bde04f-f25b-43e8-b48c-d8f84d363e57","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"a1be3f5f-393a-43a9-a2cd-c416bd79d68f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d3b46430-06e7-428c-b06c-ae2de5de58ba","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » ls -R\n.:\ndst  src\n\n./dst:\nhello  hello.c\n\n./src:\nhello.c  hello.md  hello2.md","collabId":"81ec0080-616b-42d9-ae1c-4af872b7354c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"5b1f9f47-ce11-40df-bbb7-d8d1f36effce","title":"tree","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"5e731f11-73f2-4549-9750-d04e286fdd22","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"f1073e11-02a0-4100-b20d-1aee1c975c09","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"14b0fc12-0cb6-41ef-86de-473098c6a5d9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│   ├── hello\n│   └── hello.c\n└── src\n    ├── hello.c\n    ├── hello.md\n    └── hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","collabId":"6fcdc71c-e982-455c-820c-731d53e1624f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c8ee514-6827-403b-af1e-a3e637b11d7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并不是系统内置的命令，在使用之前需要进行安装，安装命令如下"}]},{"type":"tabs","tauContract":"0256f72bf503014a7ea32d073aa02da06da7e88c98797870e4d49fa627404693","collabId":"cefa9674-df86-4372-8f4e-2fe382afea34","children":[{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"8f8f581a-59d7-449f-b7cf-a858674a8e8d","title":"ls -R","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"84a68c4a-da1b-4ef2-987c-d2a74ef503b2","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"ae1d7b8a-1d3b-424b-8436-c0139ceccc4c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8a898244-71ae-4d96-8bab-cb36c30ef720","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"sudo apt install tree","collabId":"e41d8e33-186a-4686-b450-667e8659541d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"tab-pane","tabKey":"e8c6e1fb-19c6-4e89-a9c1-9f1ef5643945","title":"tree","tauContract":"fcfba932818e04e88c2c071bc4f973b1244251a453f417037be7051a453b8f66","collabId":"0e830285-9117-4a5b-a061-fced354ef651","children":[{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"c029bc9c-2bf0-4e79-91f4-40029392f626","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8a50c445-b732-41e4-9cbf-d380865344f9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"yum install tree","collabId":"0897b3ce-c13b-41e7-8116-d2bab0b9e74d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2257554d-b2e9-42d2-8cdb-2407fe83ad9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在输入密码之后就会进行下载，然后就可以愉快的使用了。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"cc288b05-36fb-436e-9db0-b28cda68786a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e06f792-367e-4f67-9901-248e124749f8","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以接收一个路径参数，来查看该路径的目录结构，默认会列出该目录下所有的内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"2de0664c-f1b1-4ede-b229-70251c967379","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e4b2d44d-6c32-44fd-aac8-597683664b2b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 列出 /tmp 的目录结构\n~ » tree /tmp\n/tmp\n├── math\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── add\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── add.c\n├── tmpscfytyzt\n└── tmux-1000\n    └── default\n\n2 directories, 4 files","collabId":"497af04a-0697-415e-b37e-858f821262cb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"05add642-6a4f-400e-8736-a7ad6daa50fa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当没有为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令指定参数时，默认会列出当前所在路径的目录结构"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"49d2d3d1-8be6-46c1-ad52-163e49b00bda","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"709f9167-01f7-4311-814c-2083545554fd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 当前所在路径为家目录，所以 tree 会列出家目录的目录结构\n~ » tree\n.\n├── dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── hello.c\n└── src\n    ├── hello.c\n    ├── hello.md\n    └── hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","collabId":"73fa131e-b45d-4d65-b2bf-c2943a55b9ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"1992d333-aec0-4053-a45b-e1eab812b636","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"84630a86-6420-4d83-be47-10b3f0211cbb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候我们根本不需要查看该目录下的所有层级内容，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-L"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项指定查看的层级深度"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"b897bdbd-77af-4f00-a84e-71deb140fe86","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4c3053a6-5e18-4484-b6ac-4ad88dbdec3c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# -L 1 查看一个层级的内容\n~ » tree -L 1 ~\n/home/xt\n├── dst\n└── src\n\n2 directories, 0 files","collabId":"d28fea21-d5b7-4bbb-9db2-6cd97e9f9949","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"664a6bb5-6db8-4374-8427-b5714a557fc8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6000f117-8b7d-4cc8-9559-2263d2d16b32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-s"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项可以显示文件的大小"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"795590ab-7ccf-4400-a95a-a3a64d81c95c","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"60dafbc6-3861-4a10-8057-59ba0c0eded2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » tree -s ~\n/home/xt\n├── [       4096]  dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── [      16696]  hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── [         75]  hello.c\n└── [       4096]  src\n    ├── [         75]  hello.c\n    ├── [          0]  hello.md\n    └── [          0]  hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","collabId":"a5d1dd06-f126-4859-ae5e-ce80b2b0982f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"e6598547-3e8c-4078-9b9e-f2bfd54fbb21","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c013457-fdb7-4302-ba26-79cded411069","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述显示的文件大小信息的单位为字节，我们可以添加 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-h"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项，以人类更加可读的形式显示文件大小"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"a676d20e-4016-4188-a14e-86b99d703304","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d1928683-0923-4356-87a0-8776dd8b24cf","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"~ » tree -sh ~\n/home/xt\n├── [4.0K]  dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── [ 16K]  hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── [  75]  hello.c\n└── [4.0K]  src\n    ├── [  75]  hello.c\n    ├── [   0]  hello.md\n    └── [   0]  hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 5 files","collabId":"ae5d2611-7135-4c9c-b59e-2b054f381fec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"689b0aa2-4f94-42f9-a491-38b154d06399","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述文件大小的单位不在仅仅是字节，对于较大的文件会自动选择相应的单位显示。"}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"ac09ab12-50e8-4a70-9a6c-71cf3fa2c0a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20fcd027-9246-438d-afea-51a1fcc4afce","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 默认会将目录信息打印在显示器上，我们可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-o"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项指定将目录信息输出到某个文件中"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"ffcffe4b-663f-49f5-bede-36ce5185e519","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cb935f1c-9639-40dc-a069-4aed6586b0ba","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 将家目录信息输出到 home.txt 中\n~ » tree -o home.txt ~\n# cat 命令用来查看文件内容，详情见查看文件章节\n~ » cat home.txt\n/home/xt\n├── dst\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── hello\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── hello.c\n├── home.txt\n└── src\n    ├── hello.c\n    ├── hello.md\n    └── hello2.md\n\n2 directories, 6 files","collabId":"46d40a80-196b-4e4f-98a0-059b47c9a702","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"568c86a9-4194-4399-8018-9e398fe5aca6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令的输出指定到了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"home.txt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，然后通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"cat"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令查看了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"home.txt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的内容。"}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/tree"],"createTime":1704807339736,"updateTime":1752406167078,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752406167078},"links":{"card:101":{"key":"card:101","type":"card","id":101}}}